  "implementation": [
    "Dedicated read/write/remove C export with null+zero control input, original bounded closed JSON write input, no request paths/envelope overhead",
    "Try-lock/try-send admission reserves actual copied Vec capacity before copying; all queued/running raw inputs share fixed engine credits, refunded on command drop including queue refusal, cancel, drain and unwind",
    "Original JSON shape/version/hash/count/text validation occurs on session worker before native sidecar mutation; uses held opening directory/entry lease, ordinary request handles/provenance/deadline/cancel/result ownership",
    "Original unsupported existing bytes preserved; ephemeral state remains sessionScoped; post-publication cancel/output failure may accompany commit, refresh via read",
    "Generated C/Rust/C# bindings and exact digest refreshed; record layouts unchanged; existing Swift conformance materializer now includes exact cacheHit"
  ],
